Find the output of the following SQL statements:
(I) SELECT MONTH('2026-01-01');
(II) SELECT YEAR('2026-01-01');

modelAnswer:
(I) SELECT MONTH('2026-01-01');
Output: 1
(MONTH() extracts the month number from a date; January = 1)

(II) SELECT YEAR('2026-01-01');
Output: 2026
(YEAR() extracts the 4-digit year from a date)

